<title>UK: TENNIS-INTERNATIONAL OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INTERNATIONAL OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOURNEMOUTH, England 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results</p>
<p>at the Bournemouth International Open men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>Danny Sapsford (Britain) beat Ignacio Truyol (Spain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) beat Colin Beecher (Britain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Daniel Orsanic (Argentina) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Guillermo Perez-Roldan (Argentina) beat Martin Lee (Britain)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Mariano Zabaleta (Argentina) beat Andrei Rybalko (Ukraine) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>David Skoch (Czech Republic) beat Piet Norval (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
